   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Designate furniture",
   "texto": [
    "The rooms and furniture are in o et according to their gender: in tol, et bord. The defined form adds a finish: stolen («the chair»), bordet («the table»).",
    "Det er serves to say «There's» with one or more things: Det er in tol («There's a chair.»), Det er to stoler («There are two chairs.»). You don't change er by the number."
   ]
